{"path":"header","title":"C Standard Library headers","titleHtml":"C Standard Library headers","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/header","section":"","kind":"index","summary":"The interface of C standard library is defined by the following collection of headers.","html":"<p>The interface of C standard library is defined by the following collection of headers.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c/error\"><code>&lt;assert.h&gt;</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c/error\">Conditionally compiled macro that compares its argument to zero</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex\"><code>&lt;complex.h&gt;</code></a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span>\n</td>\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/complex\">Complex number arithmetic</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c/string/byte\"><code>&lt;ctype.h&gt;</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c/string/byte\">Functions to determine the type contained in character data</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c/error\"><code>&lt;errno.h&gt;</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c/error\">Macros reporting error conditions</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv\"><code>&lt;fenv.h&gt;</code></a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span>\n</td>\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv\">Floating-point environment</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c/types/limits#Limits_of_floating-point_types\"><code>&lt;float.h&gt;</code></a>\n</td>\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c/types/limits#Limits_of_floating-point_types\">Limits of floating-point types</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c/types/integer\"><code>&lt;inttypes.h&gt;</code></a> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span>\n</td>\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c/types/integer\">Format conversion of integer types</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <a href=\"/w/c